  "loc": "Abstract, p.1; Section 1 Introduction, p.1",
  "quote": "We propose to model selection problems with strategic candidates as a contest game",
  "note": "The paper studies a contest game in which candidates for college admission or hiring choose effort. A single Bayesian decision-maker then selects the top fraction based on noisy quality estimates. No voting procedure aggregates several agents' inputs into a collective decision, so the paper is a selection or contest and fairness paper, not a voting paper. Coding stopped here."
